   "issue": "`Kinematics.swap` (`\u27e8K.x, -K.skewness, K.kT, -K.deltaT\u27e9`) swaps nothing: it negates two fields. Since `kT` and `deltaT` are both `E\u00b2`, reading `K.swap` as the (type-correct, plausible) exchange of the two transverse fields is a live misreading, propagated through `x_swap`/`skewness_swap`/`kT_swap`/`deltaT_swap`/`swap_swap`/`tMom_swap`/`isPhysical_swap`/`ofMomenta_swap`. Elsewhere in the repo `swap` means a literal exchange (`PDF/Isospin.lean:16` `Equiv.swap u d`), while a sign-flipping involution on a kinematics structure is named for the operation.",
